<title>GERMANY: Preussag Q1 sales, new orders down, profit up.</title>
<headline>Preussag Q1 sales, new orders down, profit up.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Dec 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    6,100   vs 6,300</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		     13,700  vs 13,300</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,300   vs 6,800</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German steel and engineering group is Preussag AG. The company said that its first quarter results were higher than a year earlier but gave no figures.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom +49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
